```{=html}
<ol class="pub-list">
<% for (const item of items) { %>
<li class="pub-row" <%= metadataAttrs(item) %>>
<span class="pub-year"><%= item.forthcoming ? "Forthcoming" : item.date %></span>
<div class="pub-body">
<a class="pub-title" href="<%- item.path %>"><%= item.title %></a>
<p class="pub-meta"><%= item.authors %>. <em><%= item.venue %></em></p>
</div>
<span class="pub-type"><%= item.type %></span>
</li>
<% } %>
</ol>
```
